1:{ev:["Jonas feels nervous about the December Ceremony.","An aircraft flies over the community by mistake.","The Speaker says the pilot will be released.","Jonas's father works as a Nurturer for newchildren.","Jonas's father brings Gabriel home for extra care.","Jonas remembers a strange moment with an apple."],keys:["nervous","aircraft","released","nurturer","gabriel","apple"]},
2:{ev:["Jonas, Asher and Fiona volunteer at the House of the Old.","Larissa describes Roberto's release as a happy celebration.","Jonas has a dream about Fiona and a bathtub.","Jonas begins to take a pill every morning.","Gabriel receives an extra year instead of release.","Jonas's group of Twelves waits for the second day."],keys:["volunteer","larissa","dream","pill","gabriel","waits"]},
